    {
        "type": "comment",
        "name": "Heat Pump History (readme)",
        "info": "# Heat pump history\n\nCalculates per day, from **all** Home Assistant history:\n- average outside temperature `sensor.sparrow_p60_heat_pump_outside_temperature`\n- average water target temperature `sensor.sparrow_p60_heat_pump_water_target_temperature`\n- average power and energy `sensor.sparrow_p60_heat_pump`\n- average COP `sensor.heatpump_cop_not_below_0`, COP = 0 is excluded\n\nEach step is a group:\n\n1. **Trigger**: daily at 00:05 and at deploy. `Settings` holds the thresholds and the sensors\n2. **Get all history**\n   - *State history*: exact, only as far back as the recorder keeps it (`purge_keep_days`, default 10 days)\n   - *Long-term statistics*: hourly mean/min/max, kept forever. Only for sensors with a `state_class`\n3. **Daily values**: time-weighted averages per day from the state history, and per day from the\n   statistics. Only days with data for >= `min_day_coverage` of the day\n4. **Select days**: the state history wins over the statistics. Only days on which the heat pump\n   has been used: energy >= `min_day_energy` and power above `min_run_power` at some point\n5. **Relation to outside temperature**: `fit` (value = slope * outside_temp + intercept, used as heating\n   curve by the feedforward), `averages` and `curve` (averages per whole °C outside temperature)\n6. **Output**: `global.heat_pump_history` (incl. the list of days) and event `heat_pump_history`\n   -> `sensor.heat_pump_history`",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": [],
        "id": "97cc30e835d6399d",
        "z": "637c08aefe059a43"
    },
